            "review_title": "Review at Lão Tam Quán",
            "review_text": "Rob Nesbit\nWarsaw, Poland6919 contributions\n0\nFood though was not the best\nJun 2022\nHere a few times as it was very near my accommodation and about the only real place to get food within a few short steps.\nNice and comfy and with a cover outside.\nFood though was not the best, to be honest, very dry and portions were quite small.\nBit annoying that when I asked for more fries they gave me a plate of fries, extra charge of course.......rather than topping up the plate.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 26, 2022",
